Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRZMdJijWaruxdkyjADOuMaMX_iODk6HIzjFi4I8xjqhw&oe=6AFC88E0"}, {"file_name": "F1_Lista_Drills.png", "id": "2985237505181911", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673751957_2985237508515244_3899634843424591236_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aYFLwDypzPQQ7kNvwGwb3uC&_nc_oc=AdpC3QqVfY2WckwADUa8ZUoXIkqOQFU48sIIpSf6CvXXCMNvTcO81q3-MxW-7DrWe2g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS0xsMJns2NzpWVDozHqWzVrC1S2BlXxZFEoK3KWKAm1A&oe=6AFC7A5E"}, {"file_name": "G_Inmersivo_Club.png", "id": "1426678162944073", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830576_1426678192944070_7268443642413937078_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iumM6LmLvZsQ7kNvwF94YFE&_nc_oc=Adrdu6J_Zy2rdKlPC-h2hKnJqsM4oYonJaH9nxgo0vw-I3ZO-O3qUfjHqz2rscgCmww&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRBDnt2GVLM-g4zcuTa4a2ah11YvhWP9il6Kz81rjSdbA&oe=6AFC5F59"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "PADEL 01", "keywords": ["padel", "padeltennis", "padelgame", "padelsimulator", "vrsports"], "long_description": "Bring padel home: a free padel simulator for Quest 3 and 3S.\n\n**Play matches**\nSingles and doubles against bots across six difficulty levels. Discover a padel game built around spin, placement and glass rebounds.\n\n**Train like a pro**\n12 drills, including back wall, side wall, lob, volley, bandeja, v\u00edbora, smash, serve and reflexes.\n\n**Your court, your space**\nBring VR sports into your room with passthrough, portal or full VR. Choose four court sizes, from home presets to full size (10 x 20 m).\n\n**Compete**\nTake on the Weekly drill challenge, track personal bests and join optional monthly drill rankings.\n\n**Free**\nNo ads. No purchases. Explore virtual reality sports at your own pace.\n\n**Movement and comfort**\nMatches and drills use physical movement, with no teleport, joystick locomotion or artificial turning. Suitable drills can be played standing in a small, clear space; leave room to swing. Choose a court size that fits your safe area. Passthrough keeps your surroundings visible. Start gently, take breaks and stop if you feel discomfort.\n\n**Early Access - 0.1.2-ea**\nImproved Weekly score submission and ranking feedback.\n\nWilzig Studio\nhttps://discord.gg/Ra2DKZM89Z", "short_description": "Bring padel home. A free padel simulator for Quest 3 and 3S: bot matches, drills and mixed reality."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1490005339677773", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "PADEL 01", "keywords": ["padel", "padeltennis", "padelgame", "padelsimulator", "vrsports"], "long_description": "Lleva el p\u00e1del a casa: simulador de p\u00e1del gratis para Quest 3 y 3S.\n\n**Juega partidos**\nIndividuales y dobles contra bots con seis niveles de dificultad. Practica efectos, colocaci\u00f3n y rebotes en el cristal.\n\n**Entrena como un profesional**\n12 ejercicios: pared de fondo, pared lateral, globo, volea, bandeja, v\u00edbora, remate, saque, reflejos y m\u00e1s.\n\n**Tu pista, tu espacio**\nElige passthrough, portal o realidad virtual completa. Cuatro tama\u00f1os de pista, desde opciones para casa hasta tama\u00f1o real (10 x 20 m).\n\n**Compite**\nSupera el reto semanal de ejercicios, mejora tus r\u00e9cords y participa en rankings mensuales opcionales de ejercicios.\n\n**Gratis**\nSin anuncios ni compras. Disfruta del deporte en realidad virtual a tu ritmo.\n\n**Movimiento y comodidad**\nPartidos y ejercicios usan movimiento f\u00edsico, sin teletransporte, desplazamiento con joystick ni giro artificial. Los ejercicios adecuados pueden jugarse de pie en un espacio peque\u00f1o y despejado, dejando sitio para el swing. Ajusta la pista a tu \u00e1rea segura. Passthrough permite ver tu entorno. Empieza suavemente, descansa y para si notas molestias.\n\n**Acceso anticipado - 0.1.2-ea**\nMejoras en el env\u00edo de puntuaciones del reto semanal y en los mensajes de clasificaci\u00f3n.\n\nWilzig Studio\nhttps://discord.gg/Ra2DKZM89Z", "short_description": "Lleva el p\u00e1del a casa. Simulador de p\u00e1del gratis para Quest 3 y 3S: bots, ejercicios y realidad mixta."}]}, "developer_name": "Wilzig Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/padel-01-privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Wilzig Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://discord.gg/Ra2DKZM89Z", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1880408626737444"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/654956704_1413176290974716_1551074545287779193_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wII0jSAt42oQ7kNvwESRYx8&_nc_oc=AdpZhdVKy41d0aHR77CzLAVSlbrKS8VHe8CT8whkhJ1QLDGCLGp2acVO2TR3Ofl1we0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRdsuMREpt57vYz9yFGJzedR2Y0IKEAbB8r6ROJIhAi1w&oe=6AFC8B25"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "PADEL 01", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Sports", "id": "2776542286000603"}, {"topic_name": "Simulation", "id": "331529188132278"}], "release_date": 1793116800, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "1859477198830587", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "1859477185497255", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "2050012628978031"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2122319538377249", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "PADEL 01", "keywords": [], "long_description": "PADEL 01 trae el p\u00e1del a Meta Quest. La pista aparece en tu habitaci\u00f3n al tama\u00f1o que cabe en tu espacio, y cada golpe sigue la f\u00edsica del p\u00e1del: efectos, botes y rebotes en el cristal de fondo y lateral.\n\nQU\u00c9 PUEDES JUGAR YA\n- Partidos individuales y de dobles contra bots, de nivel Gentle a Pro\n- Peloteo libre para calentar y practicar a tu ritmo\n- Ejercicios de pared de fondo, pared lateral, globo, volea, bandeja, v\u00edbora, remate, saque, reflejos y m\u00e1s, con estrellas y r\u00e9cords\n- Rankings online opcionales del reto mensual de ejercicios y de la liga contra bots\n- Tres formas de pala con sensaciones propias: redonda para control, l\u00e1grima equilibrada y diamante para potencia\n- Pista en passthrough, portal o inmersi\u00f3n total\n\nACCESO ANTICIPADO\nPADEL 01 es gratis y est\u00e1 en acceso anticipado. Esta versi\u00f3n no incluye multijugador online, avatares, tienda ni compras dentro de la app. Lo pr\u00f3ximo: el club PADEL 01 con partidos online, torneos, avatares y cosm\u00e9ticos. Nada de lo que se compre dar\u00e1 ventaja en el juego.\n\nLos rankings, la copia de progreso en la nube y los diagn\u00f3sticos de prueba son opcionales y se activan o desactivan en los ajustes de privacidad.\n\n\u00danete a la comunidad y cu\u00e9ntanos qu\u00e9 mejorar: https://discord.gg/h44S3ZS3yn\n\nJuega en un espacio despejado de al menos 2 x 2 m y con el l\u00edmite de seguridad del visor activado.", "short_description": "P\u00e1del real en realidad mixta. Tu habitaci\u00f3n se convierte en una pista: juega individuales y dobles contra bots, usa el cristal de fondo y lateral, y entrena voleas, bandejas y remates con tres palas que se sienten distintas."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cover_portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "1847437599625484", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831964_1847437602958817_1932268585465311854_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q6ZvfFVpZtsQ7kNvwHR7Cbn&_nc_oc=AdqdsTaO6QNtq1tusjkXU53UnoMR91HczFNobePpPp9SUE9rvTcDYdMLh5Rg44I4z_I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTFWF-xLKrNAHyHDElhFuffKxOo5_wYVLmJJicJwmfUgg&oe=6AFC66B7"}, {"file_name": "icono_padel_encima_01_512.png", "id": "1615103232778838", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595119480_1615103236112171_833100873922920005_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aQf0f1gozXkQ7kNvwHLr-BR&_nc_oc=AdqfzKVRMap8Tdm9Sxl0DzW3JAZiCVEFU7c3vKGpgKuqHtP-LXbVaTTu8daYbxAsARY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT4Nzxb-xOwXRXKRXbLm4GQVG7a8_TWPnW3TyK9Dc5TkA&oe=6AFC6E89"}, {"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE.png", "id": "1442581991333530", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596061819_1442581994666863_1976113991309412542_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eT3Adv-PMDgQ7kNvwF5AcaC&_nc_oc=AdpeHQleSQTiRu_wEprmD4is_hjl42CX6-zJHfWRoZzIete9oIUItTVNk0tzWIShN